            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwonka embabazi zangye tizirimurugaho, nk'oku naaziihire ahari Saulo, ou naacwire nkaiha omu maisho gaawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enju yaawe n'obugabe bwawe biryahamibwa ebiro byona, n'ekitebe ky'obugabe bwawe kiryaba eky'ebiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo bigambo byona n'okwo kworekwa kwona, Nasani yaabiteekyerereza Daudi nk'oku byabaire biri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Daudi omugabe yaataaha omu Ihema, yaashutama omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yaagira ati: Niinye oha, ai MUKAMA Ruhanga? Kandi n'enju yangye nikyo ki, iwe okundinda okampitsya aha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ekyo ahariiwe ni kikye, MUKAMA Ruhanga; mbwenu waayongyeraho n'okugamba aha by'enju y'omwiru waawe, oku eriba omu biro bingi munonga ebiriija, nk'oku kiba omu biragiro by'abantu, ai MUKAMA Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.139.1+PSA.139.2+PSA.139.3+PSA.139.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 139:1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu shi, ekindi Daudi akugambire ki? Ahabw'okuba noomanya omwiru waawe, MUKAMA Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabw'endagaano yaawe okakora ebikuru ebyo byona, kubimanyisa omwiru waawe, nk'oku omutima gwawe gwateekateekire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
